### 1. Failed Transfers

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferFailed"
| summarize Failures = count()
    by FromAccount = tostring(customDimensions.FromAccount),
       bin(timestamp, 5m)
| order by timestamp desc
```

---

### 2. Fraud Detection (> 5 Failures per Account in 10 Minutes)

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferFailed"
| summarize Attempts = count()
    by FromAccount = tostring(customDimensions.FromAccount),
       bin(timestamp, 10m)
| where Attempts > 5
| order by Attempts desc
```

---

### 3. All Transfer Activity (Attempts, Successes, Failures)

```kql
customEvents
| where name in (
    "FundsTransferAttempt",
    "FundsTransferSuccess",
    "FundsTransferFailed"
)
| summarize EventCount = count()
    by name,
       bin(timestamp, 5m)
| render timechart
```

---

### 4. Failed Transfers by Reason

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferFailed"
| summarize Failures = count()
    by Reason = tostring(customDimensions.Reason),
       bin(timestamp, 10m)
| render barchart
```

---

### 5. Success vs Failure Ratio

```kql
customEvents
| where name in (
    "FundsTransferSuccess",
    "FundsTransferFailed"
)
| summarize
    Success = countif(name == "FundsTransferSuccess"),
    Failure = countif(name == "FundsTransferFailed")
| project
    Success,
    Failure,
    SuccessRate = round(todouble(Success) / (Success + Failure) * 100, 2),
    FailureRate = round(todouble(Failure) / (Success + Failure) * 100, 2)
```

---

### 6. High-Risk Accounts (More Than 3 Failed Attempts in 10 Minutes)

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferFailed"
| summarize FailedAttempts = count()
    by FromAccount = tostring(customDimensions.FromAccount),
       bin(timestamp, 10m)
| where FailedAttempts > 3
| order by FailedAttempts desc
```

---

### 7. Transaction Amount Distribution

```kql
customEvents
| where name in (
    "FundsTransferSuccess",
    "FundsTransferFailed"
)
| extend Amount = todouble(customDimensions.Amount)
| summarize
    AvgAmount = round(avg(Amount), 2),
    MaxAmount = max(Amount),
    MinAmount = min(Amount)
    by name
```

---

### 8. Top Transfer Destinations

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferSuccess"
| summarize TransferCount = count()
    by ToAccount = tostring(customDimensions.ToAccount)
| order by TransferCount desc
| take 10
```

---

### 9. Top Source Accounts by Transfer Volume

```kql
customEvents
| where name == "FundsTransferSuccess"
| extend Amount = todouble(customDimensions.Amount)
| summarize
    TotalTransferred = sum(Amount),
    TransactionCount = count()
    by FromAccount = tostring(customDimensions.FromAccount)
| order by TotalTransferred desc
```

---

### 10. Transfer Activity Dashboard Query

```kql
customEvents
| where name in (
    "FundsTransferAttempt",
    "FundsTransferSuccess",
    "FundsTransferFailed"
)
| summarize TotalEvents = count() by name
```

These 10 queries provide a complete Application Insights monitoring dashboard covering transaction volume, success rates, failures, fraud detection, transfer amounts, and account activity.
